  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a href=\"https://abvmuup.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU Uttar Pradesh</span></a>&nbsp;</span>has released the answer key for UP Common Nursing Entrance Test UP CNET 2026 on its official website. Online applying process for UP CNET Online Form 2026 were accepted from 28 March 2026 to 20 May 2026. The Examination was held on 06 June 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their UP CNET Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP CNET Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>28 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>20 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>20 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<b>13-20 May 2026&nbsp;</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :&nbsp;<b>06 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available : <b>30 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key Available : <b>09 June 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC : <strong>Rs. 3,000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 2,000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through Challan Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP CNET Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 31 December 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>17 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP CNET Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: B.SC Nursing 4 Years, Post B.SC Nursing Course 2 Years, M.SC Nursing / Nurse Practitioner in Critical Care NPCC 2 Years</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Conduct</span>&nbsp;</strong>: Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP CNET Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.5417%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Course Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.4583%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Eligibility</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.5417%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. Nursing (4 Years)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.4583%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed 10+2 Intermediate Exam in Physics, Chemistry and Biology (PCB) Group with 45% Marks will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.5417%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Basic B.Sc. Nursing (2 Years)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.4583%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed 10+2 Intermediate Exam Passed with Certificate in General Nursing and Midwifery GNM and Registered in Nursing Council will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.5417%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">M.Sc. Nursing / NPCC (2 Years)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.4583%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have B.SC Nursing / B.Sc Hons Nursing / Post Basic B.Sc Nursing with 55% Marks with Registered in Nursing Council &amp; have 1 Year of Work Experience will be eligible for this admission.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP CNET Admissions 2026 : Participating Institute / University</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SGPGIMS, Lucknow</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">KGMU, Lucknow</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">RMLIMS, Lucknow</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UPUMS, Saifai</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">LLRM, Meerut</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Nursing Colleges Affiliated to ABVMU &amp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Govt. &amp; Private Universities / Deemed Universities of U.P</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UP CNET Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span 